{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t​行政長官李家超宣布，房屋局局長何永賢已向他提出請辭。行政長官依照《基本法》第四十八條第五款的規定，已報請中央人民政府，建議免去何永賢的房屋局局長職務。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n即日起，何永賢停止房屋局局長的職務，財政司副司長黃偉綸兼任署理房屋局局長的職務。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:13.133810+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:14:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T18:39:22.272682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:35.510349+00:00","content_hash":"47cc70d8296e4d15d65dd1af7bcc67c9ce0140c6d1eea8f80e0055599a46b9ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}